  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Universal Postal Union: Core Contribution</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia Post makes an annual core contribution to the Universal Postal Union (UPU) of about 870,000 CHF. This contribution is subject to annual change as the UPU&apos;s contribution system is based around contribution units, the value of which changes based on contribution unit numbers of other member states. This contribution funds the UPU&apos;s core activities, including postal development assistance activities in LDCs and SIDS. Funds for this contribution are generated by Australia Post&apos;s postal activities and are not provided by the Commonwealth. Australia Post makes this payment on behalf of it and the Australian Government under an MoU between the Department and Australia Post.</narrative>
  </description>
